  "name": "xml-rs",
  "description": "A pure-Rust XML library providing a pull-based parser and a streaming emitter inspired by Java's StAX API. It implements a memory-efficient, event-driven interface for reading and writing XML documents with comprehensive namespace support. The project prioritizes a streaming architecture to handle large documents without requiring full DOM construction in memory.",
